{"id":"0ddc2f4aa380ea29","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-simple-exists.md","title":"Post 简单集合的存在","display":"thm-simple-exists — Post 简单集合的存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-simple-exists","aliases":["20-thm-simple-exists"],"display":"thm-simple-exists — Post 简单集合的存在","chapter":"5","section":"5.2.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.2.3；Definition 5.2.4 后的观察","source_pdf_pages":[144,145],"source_printed_pages":[109,110],"depends_on":["[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-effective-simple]]","[[20-df-principal-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-simple-exists"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-simple-exists</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-simple-exists — Post 简单集合的存在"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.2.3；Definition 5.2.4 后的观察"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>144</span><span>145</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>109</span><span>110</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ec173dab9734388\" href=\"?note=3ec173dab9734388\" title=\"20-df-effective-simple\">20-df-effective-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"145fee39d6716fb8\" href=\"?note=145fee39d6716fb8\" title=\"20-df-principal-function\">20-df-principal-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 是递增有限统一阶段枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 表示待构造的 c.e. 集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:=\\omega\\setminus A\">\\(B:=\\omega\\setminus A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}\">\\(\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B\">\\(p_B\\)</span> 采用所引定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3ec173dab9734388\" href=\"?note=3ec173dab9734388\" title=\"20-df-effective-simple\">20-df-effective-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"145fee39d6716fb8\" href=\"?note=145fee39d6716fb8\" title=\"20-df-principal-function\">20-df-principal-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A),\\\\\n\\forall e\\ (W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le 2e+1),\\\\\n\\forall n\\ p_{\\omega\\setminus A}(n)\\le 2n\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A),\\\\\n\\forall e\\ (W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le 2e+1),\\\\\n\\forall n\\ p_{\\omega\\setminus A}(n)\\le 2n\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0=\\varnothing\">\\(A_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 搜索最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e&lt;s\">\\(e&lt;s\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\">\\(W_{e,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\\)</span> 且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_{e,s}\">\\(x\\in W_{e,s}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;2e\">\\(x&gt;2e\\)</span>；若存在则把最小这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 放入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。这是可计算有限搜索。每个要求至多行动一次，因为行动后其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 已与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 相交。</p>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,2n]\">\\([0,2n]\\)</span> 的成员只能来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e&lt;n\">\\(e&lt;n\\)</span> 的行动，总数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。该区间有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2n+1\">\\(2n+1\\)</span> 个数，所以至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个在最终补集中；这同时证明补集无限及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B(n)\\le 2n\">\\(p_B(n)\\le 2n\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 无限而永不与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 相交，在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;e\">\\(i&lt;e\\)</span> 的最后行动之后，它出现某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;2e\">\\(x&gt;2e\\)</span>，随后该要求必被选中，矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 简单。</p>\n<p>更强地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq B\">\\(W_e\\subseteq B\\)</span> 中有一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;2e\">\\(x&gt;2e\\)</span>，等待所有较小要求停止行动及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 出现，同一论证给矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq[0,2e]\">\\(W_e\\subseteq[0,2e]\\)</span>，基数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2e+1\">\\(2e+1\\)</span>，得到有效简单性。这里没有把原书抽取文本丢失的补集横线误读成对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 本身的主函数上界。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 109–110 / PDF 144–145。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-effective-simple","status":"resolved","id":"3ec173dab9734388","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-effective-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-principal-function","status":"resolved","id":"145fee39d6716fb8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-principal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6